WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 7.3 · Brand, Identity & Image
Brand personality, voice and tone

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Your voice stays the same; your tone adapts to each situation.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Choose three or four traits from your values.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Write each trait as “this, not that”.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. List words you use and words you avoid.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Pan del Barrio: proud, not boastful. Warm, not sentimental. We say “bakers in training”, never “at-risk youth”.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your personality traits, word list and tones.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
